---
// Orca power-user lesson — follows 0001-vim-core-loop conventions
// (bilingual data-lang spans, is:raw body, shared assets, no emojis).
import Lesson from "../../../../layouts/Lesson.astro";
const titlePt = "Orca — o cockpit dos agentes";
const titleEn = "Orca — the agent cockpit";
const titleFallback = "Orca — the agent cockpit";
const bodyClass = "lang-pt";
const viewport = "width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0";
const assets = [
	"<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../assets/style.css\" />",
	"<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../assets/dark.css\" />",
	"<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../assets/i18n.css\" />",
	"<script src=\"../assets/i18n.js\" defer></script>",
	"<script src=\"../assets/nav.js\" defer></script>",
	"<script src=\"../assets/reading-ui.js\" defer></script>",
];

---
<Lesson
	titlePt={titlePt}
	titleEn={titleEn}
	titleFallback={titleFallback}
	bodyClass={bodyClass}
	viewport={viewport}
	assets={assets}
>
	<Fragment is:raw>
    <article class="lesson">
      <header class="hero">
        <span class="eyebrow">⬡ Tooling · Orca 01</span>
        <h1>
          <span data-lang="pt">Vários agentes. Um cockpit.</span
          ><span data-lang="en">Many agents. One cockpit.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="lead">
          <span data-lang="pt"
            >Em 10 minutos: o modelo de worktrees, seis atalhos que você usa
            todo dia e um circuito de 2 minutos para pilotar vários agentes sem
            se perder.</span
          ><span data-lang="en"
            >In 10 minutes: the worktree model, six shortcuts you use daily,
            and a two-minute circuit to pilot several agents without getting
            lost.</span
          >
        </p>
      </header>

      <h2 class="section">
        <span class="num">1</span
        ><span data-lang="pt">O modelo: tarefa → worktree</span
        ><span data-lang="en">The model: task → worktree</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        <span data-lang="pt"
          >Orca é um <strong>ADE</strong> (Agent Development Environment): ele
          roda Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode e qualquer agente CLI lado a lado.
          <strong
            >Cada tarefa ganha um worktree git real</strong
          >, com terminal, agente e navegador próprios.</span
        ><span data-lang="en"
          >Orca is an <strong>ADE</strong> (Agent Development Environment): it
          runs Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, and any CLI agent side by side.
          <strong>Every task gets a real git worktree</strong>, with its own
          terminal, agent, and browser.</span
        >
      </p>
      <div class="grid cols-2">
        <div class="card">
          <span class="kbd">worktree</span>
          <h3><span data-lang="pt">Uma tarefa</span><span data-lang="en">One task</span></h3>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Terminal + agente + abas isolados. Trocar de worktree troca a
              árvore inteira de painéis — e ela volta como você deixou.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >Isolated terminal + agent + tabs. Switching worktrees swaps the
              whole pane tree—and it returns exactly as you left it.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="kbd">dots</span>
          <h3><span data-lang="pt">Atenção</span><span data-lang="en">Attention</span></h3>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Na sidebar: <strong>verde</strong> = agente trabalhando,
              <strong>amarelo</strong> = esperando você. Amarelo primeiro.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >In the sidebar: <strong>green</strong> = agent working,
              <strong>yellow</strong> = waiting for you. Yellow first.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="callout key">
        <span data-lang="pt"
          >Nada é mágico: <strong>todo worktree é um worktree git de
          verdade</strong> — entre com <code>cd</code> e use git puro quando
          quiser.</span
        ><span data-lang="en"
          >Nothing is magic: <strong>every worktree is a real git
          worktree</strong>—<code>cd</code> in and use plain git whenever you
          want.</span
        >
      </div>
      <p class="cite">
        <span data-lang="pt">Fonte primária:</span
        ><span data-lang="en">Primary source:</span>
        <a href="https://www.onorca.dev/docs/model/worktrees"
          >Orca docs · Worktrees</a
        >
      </p>

      <h2 class="section">
        <span class="num">2</span
        ><span data-lang="pt">Seu primeiro vocabulário</span
        ><span data-lang="en">Your first vocabulary</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        <span data-lang="pt"
          >Associe cada atalho a um objetivo:
          <strong>navegar, abrir, dividir, sair</strong>.</span
        ><span data-lang="en"
          >Tie each shortcut to an intent:
          <strong>navigate, open, split, close</strong>.</span
        >
      </p>
      <div class="grid cols-4">
        <div class="card">
          <span class="kbd">Cmd-J</span>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt">pular p/ worktree</span
            ><span data-lang="en">jump to worktree</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="kbd">Cmd-P</span>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt">abrir arquivo</span
            ><span data-lang="en">open file</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="kbd">Cmd-T</span>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt">novo terminal</span
            ><span data-lang="en">new terminal</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="kbd">Cmd-\</span>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt">dividir à direita</span
            ><span data-lang="en">split right</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="kbd">Cmd-Alt-T</span>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt">novo agente</span
            ><span data-lang="en">new agent</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="kbd">Cmd-F</span>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt">buscar no scrollback</span
            ><span data-lang="en">search scrollback</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="kbd">Cmd-W</span>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt">fechar aba</span
            ><span data-lang="en">close tab</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="kbd">Cmd-Alt-A</span>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt">terminal flutuante</span
            ><span data-lang="en">floating terminal</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top: 16px">
        <div class="card">
          <h3><span class="kbd">Cmd-Shift-]</span> / <span class="kbd">[</span></h3>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt">próxima / anterior aba</span
            ><span data-lang="en">next / previous tab</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3><span class="kbd">Cmd-1…6</span></h3>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt">sessões recentes, na paleta</span
            ><span data-lang="en">recent sessions, in the palette</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="cite">
        <a href="https://www.onorca.dev/docs/model/quick-open">paleta</a> ·
        <a href="https://www.onorca.dev/docs/terminal">terminal</a> ·
        <a href="https://www.onorca.dev/docs/model/tabs-panes-splits"
          >abas e painéis</a
        >
      </p>

      <h2 class="section">
        <span class="num">3</span
        ><span data-lang="pt">Faça agora: um circuito de 2 minutos</span
        ><span data-lang="en">Do it now: a two-minute circuit</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        <span data-lang="pt"
          >Com o Orca aberto, o feedback é imediato: a paleta responde a cada
          tecla.</span
        ><span data-lang="en"
          >With Orca open, feedback is immediate: the palette responds to every
          keystroke.</span
        >
      </p>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>
          <span data-lang="pt">Sequência</span
          ><span data-lang="en">Sequence</span>
        </h3>
        <ol>
          <li>
            <span class="kbd">Cmd-J</span> <span data-lang="pt">sem digitar nada: veja as sessões por atenção — amarelo primeiro.</span><span data-lang="en">without typing: see sessions by attention—yellow first.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span data-lang="pt">Digite um nome de tarefa; sem resultado, a própria paleta oferece</span>
            <span data-lang="en">Type a task name; with no match, the palette offers</span>
            <em>Create worktree</em> — <span class="kbd">Enter</span>.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="kbd">Cmd-T</span> <span data-lang="pt">terminal novo;</span><span data-lang="en">new terminal;</span>
            <span class="kbd">Cmd-\</span> <span data-lang="pt">divida e veja dois shells lado a lado.</span><span data-lang="en">split and see two shells side by side.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="kbd">Cmd-J</span> <span data-lang="pt">de novo, digite</span><span data-lang="en">again, type</span>
            <code>#123</code> <span data-lang="pt">para achar um worktree por PR.</span><span data-lang="en">to find a worktree by PR.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="kbd">Cmd-W</span> <span data-lang="pt">fecha a aba. Circuit completo.</span><span data-lang="en">closes the tab. Circuit complete.</span>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <p class="cite">
        <a href="https://www.onorca.dev/docs/recipes/jump-worktrees"
          >Receita oficial: juggling 10 worktrees</a
        >
      </p>

      <h2 class="section">
        <span class="num">4</span
        ><span data-lang="pt">Movimentos de power user</span
        ><span data-lang="en">Power-user moves</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="grid cols-2">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>
            <span data-lang="pt">Fan-out paralelo</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Parallel fan-out</span>
          </h3>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Mesmo prompt em N agentes, cada um num worktree. Compare os
              diffs, mescle o vencedor.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >Same prompt to N agents, each in a worktree. Compare diffs, merge
              the winner.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>
            <span data-lang="pt">Design Mode</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Design Mode</span>
          </h3>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Clique num elemento da UI no navegador embutido: HTML, CSS e
              screenshot vão direto ao prompt.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >Click a UI element in the embedded browser: HTML, CSS, and a
              screenshot go straight into the prompt.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>
            <span data-lang="pt">Anotar diffs</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Annotate diffs</span>
          </h3>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Comente qualquer linha do diff e mande os comentários de volta ao
              agente.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >Comment on any diff line and ship the comments back to the
              agent.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Quick Commands</h3>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Salve <code>pnpm test</code> ou prompts reutilizáveis; rode pelo
              tab bar ou menu do terminal.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >Save <code>pnpm test</code> or reusable prompts; run from the tab
              bar or terminal menu.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>
            <span data-lang="pt">Companion no celular</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Mobile companion</span>
          </h3>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Status ao vivo, notificações e follow-ups de qualquer lugar.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >Live status, notifications, and follow-ups from anywhere.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>CLI</h3>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Agentes também dirigem o Orca — o guia versionado:</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >Agents drive Orca too—the version-matched guide:</span
            >
          </p>
          <pre class="block"><code>orca skills get orca-cli</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="callout warn">
        <span data-lang="pt"
          ><strong>Higiene:</strong> delete worktrees mergeados sem pena — um
          clique remove worktree e branch. Lista grande deixa a paleta lenta.</span
        ><span data-lang="en"
          ><strong>Hygiene:</strong> delete merged worktrees aggressively—one
          click removes worktree and branch. A big list slows the palette.</span
        >
      </div>

      <h2 class="section">
        <span class="num">5</span><span data-lang="pt">Recupere sem pistas</span
        ><span data-lang="en">Retrieve without clues</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="grid cols-2">
        <details class="card">
          <summary>
            <span data-lang="pt">Cmd-J com a paleta vazia mostra o quê?</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Cmd-J with an empty palette shows what?</span>
          </summary>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Sessões recentes por atenção — amarelo primeiro, depois
              concluídas.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >Recent sessions by attention—yellow first, then done.</span
            >
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="card">
          <summary>
            <span data-lang="pt">Como abrir um worktree num split?</span
            ><span data-lang="en">How do you open a worktree in a split?</span>
          </summary>
          <p><span class="kbd">Shift-Enter</span></p>
        </details>
        <details class="card">
          <summary>
            <span data-lang="pt">O que significa ponto amarelo na sidebar?</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >What does a yellow sidebar dot mean?</span
            >
          </summary>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Agente esperando input seu. Atenda primeiro.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >Agent waiting on your input. Handle it first.</span
            >
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="card">
          <summary>
            <span data-lang="pt">Um worktree é…?</span
            ><span data-lang="en">A worktree is…?</span>
          </summary>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Um git worktree real — <code>cd</code> e git puro sempre
              funcionam.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >A real git worktree—<code>cd</code> and plain git always
              work.</span
            >
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>

      <footer class="lesson-foot">
        <div>
          <span data-lang="pt">Fonte primária:</span
          ><span data-lang="en">Primary source:</span>
          <a href="https://www.onorca.dev/docs">Orca docs</a>
        </div>
        <a class="next-card" href="../reference/vim-core-commands.html"
          ><span class="lbl"
            ><span data-lang="pt">Referência</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Reference</span></span
          >
          <div class="t">
            <span data-lang="pt">Comandos essenciais do Vim →</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Vim core commands →</span>
          </div></a
        >
        <div>
          <span data-lang="pt"
            >Algo não ficou claro? Pergunte ao agente — ele é seu
            professor.</span
          ><span data-lang="en"
            >Anything unclear? Ask the agent—your teacher.</span
          >
          · <a href="../../../index.html">⬡ Hub</a>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </article>
  </Fragment>
</Lesson>
